SUMMARY:May 2026 Primary Election Ballot Box
DESCRIPTION:Turn in your ballot for the upcoming primary election at the Square between April 28th at 8am and May 20th at 8pm. The ballot box is located near the corner of Broadway and Yamhill. For more information visit multco.us/elections.
URL:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/event/may-2026-primary-election-ballot-box/
LOCATION:Pioneer Courthouse Square\, 701 SW 6th Ave.\, Portland\, OR\, 97204\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/ballot.jpg
END:VEVENT
