SUMMARY:In Concert on Downtown’s Transit Mall – Chasing Ebenezer at Less and More Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Chasing Ebenezer will be performing at Less and More Coffee on Downtown’s transit mall! \nChasing Ebenezer is a world folk-rock band based in Portland\, Oregon. With influences from Celtic\, African\, and Middle Eastern music\, their songs make it hard for audiences to sit still. Their tunes are alive with bohemian violin licks\, world percussion\, and an ever-increasing array of instruments. The band is fronted by husband and wife team Benjamin & Heidi Beth Sadler. \n 
URL:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/event/in-concert-on-downtowns-transit-mall-chasing-ebenezer-at-less-and-more-coffee/
LOCATION:Less & More Coffee\, 1003 SW 5th Ave\, Portland\, OR\, 97204\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/photocreditnataliekristeen.jpg
END:VEVENT
