SUMMARY:Noon Tunes Summer Concert Series
DESCRIPTION:The Noon Tunes Summer Concert Series returns to The Square for its 34th year on Tuesdays and Thursdays June 2 – July 30! From Noon-1:00pm enjoy a dynamic mix of homegrown music from some of Portland’s top regional and local musical talent. With 18 FREE concerts\, dancing\, painting at Art in The Park and some of Portland’s favorite food vendors at Carts on the Square\, The Square is Downtown’s summer lunchtime destination.
URL:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/event/noon-tunes-summer-concert-series-5/2026-06-02/
LOCATION:Pioneer Courthouse Square\, 701 SW 6th Ave.\, Portland\, OR\, 97204\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/noontunes.jpg
END:VEVENT
