SUMMARY:Active Children Portland Presents The Active Wipeout!
DESCRIPTION:Active Children Portland invites you to release your inner child at the first-ever Active Wipeout! Get ready to run\, jump\, dodge\, and dive your way through high-energy inflatable obstacle courses taking over Pioneer Courthouse Square. \nJoin us June 20th from 11am–5pm for a day packed with laughs\, friendly competition\, and nonstop action. From 11am–1pm\, jump into Free Run: No registration needed\, just show up and play. Then stick around as the stakes rise from 1pm–5pm with our tournament heats\, where speed\, agility\, and bragging rights are on the line (registration and prizes coming soon!). \nWhether you’re chasing victory or just chasing your kids through the course\, Active Wipeout is built for all ages and energy levels. Bring your friends\, bring your family\, and get ready to Wipeout!
URL:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/event/active-children-portland-presents-the-active-whipeout/
LOCATION:Pioneer Courthouse Square\, 701 SW 6th Ave.\, Portland\, OR\, 97204\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Wipeout-Banner.jpg
END:VEVENT
